Bundled oneTBB notice audit (pinned OIDN archives only):
The upstream oneTBB third-party notice includes GPL-3.0 with GCC Runtime
Library Exception for its libstdc++ bug 62258 workaround. That code is guarded
by __GLIBCXX__ and libstdc++ versions >=4.7 and <6.0 in oneTBB 2023.1.0
src/tbb/exception.cpp. It is excluded for the macOS libc++ and Windows MSVC
builds. The pinned Linux libtbb.so.12.19 reports GCC 8.4.1; disassembly confirms
fix_broken_rethrow is only ret, and gcc_rethrow_exception_broken only returns
false. The GPL-derived workaround is therefore absent from these binaries.
All upstream notices are retained intact. Reaudit on any archive/pin change.
